    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a very strong start and really captures that classic, epic feeling. \n\nI want to make sure the tone stays consistent throughout the exhibit. Some people might argue that the expansion was more about conflict than \"progress,\" but for this specific introductory wall, I want to lean into that sense of national destiny. Can you expand on that text to include more about how this expansion was a natural and necessary step for the development of modern civilization?",
